gwL(){return"Your last sessions were demanding. An extra rest day will pay off more than pushing through."},
wD(a){return"This week you did "+a+"% more than your average. Ramping up that fast raises injury risk; hold the load for a few days."},
wB(a){return"You're back after "+a+" days. Today's session is lighter so you can ease back in safely."},
gwF(){return"Several sessions in a row with low energy. Check your sleep and stress; the load adjusts in the meantime."},
wE(a){return"You completed "+a+"% of the last two weeks' days. If the plan doesn't fit your routine, try fewer days a week in Settings."},
