gBQ(){return"A steady pace beats going fast on momentum."},
gBn(){return"Start each rep with arms almost straight, without hanging loose from your shoulders."},
gBo(){return"Before pulling, draw your shoulder blades down and together."},
gBp(){return"Avoid swinging: momentum takes work away from your back."},
